.Dd 2026-11-08
.Dt LBTS-UNSET 1
.\" Manual page created by:
.\" Guus Sliepen <guus@lightbts.info>
.Sh NAME
.Nm lbts unset
.Nd unset a field of a ticket
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm lbts unset
.Op Fl m Ar message
.Ar id
.Ar field
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The command unsets a field of an existing ticket,
after which it has its default value, if the field has one.
All values of a
.Ql set
field are removed.
The
.Ar id
can either be a ticket or a message ID.
.Pp
The change is recorded as a message with a pseudo-header.
If the command is run interactively, an editor is invoked where a text can be added to the message.
.Pp
.Nm lbts noowner
is a shortcut for
.Ql lbts unset Ar id Ql owner .
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl m Ar message
Use the given message instead of invoking an editor.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lbts 1 ,
.Xr lbts-set 1 ,
.Xr lbts-fields 5 .
